{
  "answer": "According to RFC 9110, the `HEAD` method is defined in **Section 9.3.2**.\n\nThe difference between `HEAD` and `GET` regarding the response body is explicitly stated:\n\n*   The `HEAD` method is identical to `GET` except that the server **MUST NOT send content in the response**.\n\nThis information is sourced from: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-9.3.2",
